    "title": "Official Trailer: Miley Cyrus transforms back into Hannah Montana for the '20th Anniversary Special'",
    "text": "On The Red CarpetWatch the official trailer for the \"Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special,\" premiering March 24 on Disney+ and Hulu.ByAmy Becker Take a trip down memory lane as Miley Cyrus dons the Hannah wig in the \"Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special,\" premiering March 24 on Disney+ and Hulu.Sweet niblets! The official trailer for the \"Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special\" has arrived!It was a TV show that defined a generation. On March 24, \"Hannah Montana\" celebrates the 20th anniversary of its debut on Disney Channel.In celebration, Disney released the official trailer for the special, featuring a musical performance by Miley Cyrus, an in-depth interview hosted by Alex Cooper and a special behind-the-scenes look at the archives.It's a trailer filled with nostalgia as Miley (as Hannah) pulls up to set in her Ford Mustang. \"Good to be home,\" she says, as \"Best of Both Worlds\" begins to play.\"I loved being Hannah. I love being Miley Cyrus. You really taught me to be who I am,\" says Miley during a heartfelt conversation with her mom, Tish Cyrus-Purcell.In addition to her mom, Miley's dad Billy Ray Cyrus (who played her on-screen dad, Robby Ray) also makes an appearance, where the two share a sentimental moment on the \"Hannah Montana\" set.\"I loved being Hannah then. I'm so living for it now. Thank you so much for being here and celebrating this with us,\" Miley says on stage.The \"Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special\" premieres March 24 on Disney+ and Hulu.The Walt Disney Company is the parent company of Disney+, Hulu and this ABC station.Copyright © 2026 OnTheRedCarpet.com. All Rights Reserved.",
